    "cbe49c7a-e130-5be3-b567-db3e4657ead7": {
      "type": "js.text",
      "props": {
        "content": "<p>We started Northwind in 2019 after watching the same failure repeat at agency after agency: a beautiful design system, a competent engineering team, and a marketing department that still could not change a page without filing a ticket.</p><p>The gap was never talent. It was that nobody owned the interface between the two groups. That interface is a component library, and it needs to be treated as a product with users, not as documentation.</p>",
        "size": "large",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
